Error [E2305]: This view points into `xs`, which this function consumes
  --> view_return_consumed_owner.jet:2:7
    |
  2 |     xs[0..<1]
    |       ^^^^^^^
 Why: `^xs` moves the value into this function, which frees it when it returns, so a returned window into it would outlive its owner
 Fix: Take `xs` as a read or `&` parameter so the caller keeps owning it, or return an owned copy with `~`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2305
